{"sha": "f8233795268bb72beccaa52f4c3fe318b9476807", "node_id": "C_kwDOT8LtWNoAKGY4MjMzNzk1MjY4YmI3MmJlY2NhYTUyZjRjM2ZlMzE4Yjk0NzY4MDc", "commit": {"author": {"name": "David Proch\u00e1zka", "email": "david@prochazka.dev", "date": "2026-08-19T10:59:37Z"}, "committer": {"name": "David Proch\u00e1zka", "email": "david@prochazka.dev", "date": "2026-08-19T10:59:56Z"}, "message": "docs: add the Zenodo DOI badge\n\nThe deposit exists now, so the README points at it, third in the badge row so the paper\nDOI and the artifact DOI sit together.\n\nBoth the badge and its link use the **concept** DOI `10.5281/zenodo.22009129`, the one\nthat always resolves to the latest version, rather than a version DOI. That is not\ncosmetic here: the tag deposited twice \u2014 `10.5281/zenodo.22009130` and\n`10.5281/zenodo.22009196`, identical content, four minutes apart \u2014 and a version DOI\nwould have enshrined whichever of the two was picked.\n\nRefs #37", "tree": {"sha": "958ba9a33fed234229670985a21a85f742cd33ec", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Coda-Research-Group/RecoverGraphANN/git/trees/958ba9a33fed234229670985a21a85f742cd33ec"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Coda-Research-Group/RecoverGraphANN/git/commits/f8233795268bb72beccaa52f4c3fe318b9476807", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEQ0iEl/7Pd6bfR3lMuL1QrPLytvIFAmqFjKwACgkQuL1QrPLy\ntvKzHA/9HKCkcCwrpiq4t5n4Vtg9rNv8Ezncr7q5Fzoh4kQ4oe1TY6/rVcVp3TTL\nl2T55RYNohDPY+S3g55QCYS7RbaHidt+mExX7TMTkbogyoaW3cJxFhiuq/rriY+L\n8ZhVdMGJzlI04xiQqB0P/+gT0qCWamc5UThQ+A3PQLe5k7bKDclRRZEuB5sIsuCS\n8+d3+/y2FueeVw+uD1867WmgzG/aAcgYfrzLKkbDs9z8inewy2UQMwxoDXdiA3Vd\nc9rgwgvcUlHIIMenX35wwVzubjb82DuZ9FQ1A49A75cdEAY113XzYzUf11eZ0DIM\nDiP+diLQmrRO+hnsNU6er92LKenJabHe35fxT+QUE55FCw0sQpu01NFVxHsMPcSM\naSLOFTSXmQXXg80zKKesko3MLrxyuUOXXXzjU6dG9i4x/r4nvNSG4pqTIvdNQ1/8\nnxvCP1AVIBnr9p8JcaVhiQmS/gy/6VZhx+lI10ZAqY7B1oUDE7RPsKVhYLvPPccE\nXUyFyk1uA6z4w6S7Uw8V5tM4gx+Yk1LaTwabqfafeTtMzBZBQ85pLAyU78wna6dH\nYrOMU8uWAjTuA4Zed7EoZiv6/y93BbjkvE1d8TmhHz8ycW8GLyfvsmybMQlsFfQp\ndsIWAicofp7wpEhIn4/g54woYzpZQN9g+/aUU5ttL7tN4c7U/ww=\n=s2q1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----", "payload": "tree 958ba9a33fed234229670985a21a85f742cd33ec\nparent 1c80f4471d5d8ae70841735afd1e73ba0c942593\nauthor David Proch\u00e1zka <david@prochazka.dev> 1787137177 +0200\ncommitter David Proch\u00e1zka <david@prochazka.dev> 1787137196 +0200\n\ndocs: add the Zenodo DOI badge\n\nThe deposit exists now, so the README points at it, third in the badge row so the paper\nDOI and the artifact DOI sit together.\n\nBoth the badge and its link use the **concept** DOI `10.5281/zenodo.22009129`, the one\nthat always resolves to the latest version, rather than a version DOI. That is not\ncosmetic here: the tag deposited twice \u2014 `10.5281/zenodo.22009130` and\n`10.5281/zenodo.22009196`, identical content, four minutes apart \u2014 and a version DOI\nwould have enshrined whichever of the two was picked.\n\nRefs #37\n", "verified_at": "2026-08-19T11:00:02Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Coda-Research-Group/RecoverGraphANN/commits/f8233795268bb72beccaa52f4c3fe318b9476807", "html_url": "https://github.com/Coda-Research-Group/RecoverGraphANN/commit/f8233795268bb72beccaa52f4c3fe318b9476807", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Coda-Research-Group/RecoverGraphANN/commits/f8233795268bb72beccaa52f4c3fe318b9476807/comments", "author": {"login": "ProchazkaDavid", "id": 2158418, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTg0MTg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2158418?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ProchazkaDavid", "html_url": "https://github.com/ProchazkaDavid", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ProchazkaDavid/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ProchazkaDavid/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ProchazkaDavid/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.git